{"id":"n65923-1-7","stage":4,"title":"시끌벅적하다 · 嘈杂","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65923-1-7-1","ko":"옆집은 오늘 왜 이렇게 시끌벅적한 거야?","zh":"隔壁今天怎么这么热闹啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옆집은","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시끌벅적한","meaning":"嘈杂，闹哄哄","explanation":"시끌벅적하다：嘈杂，闹哄哄；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"시끌벅적하다","audio":"/audio/d6657bfc71eba86ec6b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65923","senseId":"1","lemma":"시끌벅적하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"d6657bfc71eba86e","term":"시끌벅적하다","zh":"嘈杂，闹哄哄","audio":"/audio/d6657bfc71eba86ec6b8.mp3","entryId":"65923","definition":"很多人混乱移动，非常吵闹。","pronunciation":["시끌벅쩌카다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代与听话人较近的或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/9eaca440ec73b4f9ea4c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65923-1-7-2","ko":"아마 집들이를 하는 것 같아요.","zh":"大概是正在办乔迁派对吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아마","meaning":"也许","explanation":"아마：也许","readings":[{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71248","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집들이를","meaning":"乔迁宴，乔迁请客","explanation":"집들이：乔迁宴，乔迁请客；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집들이","audio":"/audio/5bfb70ad490d439e6a00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78393","senseId":"1","lemma":"집들이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2a38de25ef5f5194","term":"아마","zh":"也许","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3","entryId":"71248","definition":"虽然不能说得很明确，猜测或估计很有可能地。","pronunciation":["아마"]},{"id":"5bfb70ad490d439e","term":"집들이","zh":"乔迁宴，乔迁请客","audio":"/audio/5bfb70ad490d439e6a00.mp3","entryId":"78393","definition":"搬家后，邀请亲朋好友到家里，请他们吃饭。","pronunciation":["집뜨리"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7ca293b01e03c42f1683.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65923","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3617,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["大概是正在办乔迁派对吧。","隔壁今天怎么这么热闹啊？","我戒酒之后，身体变好了，和妻子的关系也更好了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["隔壁今天怎么这么热闹啊？","我戒酒之后，身体变好了，和妻子的关系也更好了。","大概是正在办乔迁派对吧。"],"answer":2}]}
